{"ticker":"MANAPPURAM","symbol":"MANAPPURAM","instrumentId":3111876,"name":"Manappuram Finance","industry":"NSE-Finance-Consumer Loans","about":"Manappuram Finance Ltd. is one of India’s leading non-banking financial companies (NBFCs), primarily known for its gold loan services. The company provides quick and secure loans against gold ornaments, catering to the financial needs of rural and semi-urban customers. In addition to gold loans, Manappuram has diversified its portfolio to include microfinance, vehicle loans, housing loans, and insurance products. With a wide network of branches across India, Manappuram Finance focuses on financial inclusion, offering easy access to credit for underserved communities. Its customer-centric approach, backed by strong digital infrastructure, makes it a trusted name in India’s financial services sector.","website":"www.manappuram.com","location":"Thrissur, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:40:07.505Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":282.85,"changePct":-0.05300353356889655,"week52High":371.85,"week52Low":251.1},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹23,941 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹11,363 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"490,932,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"276"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"362,465,670"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"1.06%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"1.66"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.5"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.02"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.43"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-10%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"13.29"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"6–69"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"6.3%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"-215.45"},{"label":"Volume","value":"9,927,842"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"5,377,775"},{"label":"Master score","value":"63"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"82"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"39"},{"label":"Group rank"